// s5-policy/s5_algedonic.vsm — THE ALGEDONIC CHANNEL (S5)
// Fused from: @dir_algedonic_spec{LEDGER-DEAF-FIX,LEDGER-DEAF-P3,MERKLE-F64-FIX,
