         with zero recurrence. Verify, don't assume.
       semantic_divergence — the ONE that deserves eyes — sev 7.0, 133 signals. Do NOT
         bulk-dismiss. Get the diff magnitude + what changed 07-11 before recommending ack.
       minor — s4_anomaly (4) + env_load_divergence (2), review alongside; trivial."
    boundary:
      "DS assembles EVIDENCE only (query ledger read-only; do NOT change status / write
       action_human). rmw3 reviews the package, decides per family, acks (S5 action). Every
       ∀ ack carries machine-checkable evidence (probe + observed value);
       narrative-only dismissal is what escalated these"
    resolution_state: "HOLD, per rmw3 directive.
      channel liveness must be RE-PROVEN post-LEDGER-DEAF-P3 before acking ANY
      family — the silence-based zero_recurrence claim was INVALID (§4)."
  }
}

